Flyway migrations go here.

Naming:  V1__init.sql, V2__add_pets.sql   <-- TWO underscores after the version.

Rules:
  * Never edit a migration that has already run. Add a new one.
  * Version numbers must be unique and are applied in order.
  * Turn Flyway on in application.yaml (spring.flyway.enabled: true) once
    V1__init.sql exists.

Do NOT copy Cha Ghor's V1-V38. Those are 38 incremental patches to that
domain, half of them fixes to earlier ones. Start clean at V1.
